            "text": "**\u201cDoge\u201d** is usually pronounced:\n\n**DOHJ** \u2014 like **\u201cdohj\u201d** / **\u201cdoje\u201d**  \nIPA: **/do\u028ad\u0292/**\n\nSo it rhymes roughly with **\u201cloges\u201d** or sounds like **\u201cdough\u201d + \u201cj\u201d**.\n\nIf you mean **Dogecoin**, most people say:\n\n**DOHJ-coin** \u2014 **/\u02c8do\u028ad\u0292.k\u0254\u026an/**\n\nNot usually **\u201cdoggy,\u201d \u201cdog,\u201d** or **\u201cdodge,\u201d** though **\u201cdodge\u201d** is a common mispronunciation.",
